{"path":"container/inplace_vector/try_append_range","title":"std::inplace_vector<T,N>::try_append_range","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::inplace_vector&lt;T,N&gt;::</span>try_append_range","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/try_append_range","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Appends copies of initial elements in rg before end(), until all elements are inserted or the internal storage is exhausted (i.e. size() == capacity() is true).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to\"><span class=\"kw100\">container-compatible-range</span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> R <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/borrowed_iterator_t\"><span class=\"kw2873\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">borrowed_iterator_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> try_append_range<span class=\"br0\">(</span> R<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> rg <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Appends copies of initial elements in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> before <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/end\"><code>end()</code></a>, until all elements are inserted or the internal storage is exhausted (i.e. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> capacity<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>).\n</p><p>All iterators and references remain valid. The <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/end\"><code>end()</code></a> iterator is invalidated.\n</p><p>Each iterator in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> is dereferenced at most once.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rg\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to#container_compatible_range\">container compatible range</a>, that is, an <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/input_range\"><code>input_range</code></a> whose elements are convertible to <code>T</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-hitem\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> Type requirements\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-req\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> -<div class=\"spacer\"></div><code>T</code> must be <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/EmplaceConstructible\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">EmplaceConstructible</em></a> into <code>inplace_vector</code> from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. Otherwise, the behavior is undefined.\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>An iterator pointing to the first element of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> that was not inserted into <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>, or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> if no such element exists.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Linear in the number of elements inserted.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Any exception thrown by initialization of inserted element.\n</p><p><code>inplace_vector</code> provides the <i>basic exception safety guarantee</i>, i.e., all elements of the container before the call are preserved, and all already inserted elements (before the exception, if any) are also preserved.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: Explain the purpose of this API. </div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;initializer_list&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;inplace_vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> I <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector\"><span class=\"kw3363\">std::<span class=\"me2\">inplace_vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> nums <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> I<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> rg <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> it <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> nums.<span class=\"me1\">try_append_range</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>nums.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">6</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>nums <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> I<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>it <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rg.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    it <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> nums.<span class=\"me1\">try_append_range</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>nums.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>nums <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> I<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>it <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rg.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/append_range\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>append_range</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  adds a range of elements to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/push_back\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>push_back</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  adds an element to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/try_push_back\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>try_push_back</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  tries to add an element to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/unchecked_push_bac